{"title": "Diamondsbane", "pageid": 27990, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Diamondsbane", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Diamondsbane</b> is a passive feature that makes every strike on an object deal a critical hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If an adamantine weapon hits an object, the hit is always critical. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\">Adamantine Longsword</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class